		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "118002a2-c0e4-4454-9423-aa875876ff5c")
		(at 67.37 40.309562)
		(descr "TP4056 USB-C-end corner pad: 1.0mm drill for a machined single-pin socket. J9 = IN+ (VBUS_CHG sense tap, '+' silk on the module); J10 = IN- and is NC ON PURPOSE - it anchors the module's far end without assuming IN- and OUT- are the same node. Both are mount points first: without them the module is a 21.65mm cantilever.")
